  Slug: firebrand-follower
  DisplayName: Firebrand Follower
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You were once rescued or liberated from a hopeless situation by a
    group of Firebrands, and you have since aspired to become a Firebrand to continue
    their legacy. You still follow news of their adventures, and you hope to one
    day meet your heroes as comrades. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to
    Strength or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You are trained in
    your choice of the Athletics or Performance skill as well as the Firebrand Lore
    skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Assurance] skill feat
    in your chosen skill.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Lost Omens Firebrands
  SourcePack: backgrounds
